  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Abandoned.Runtime::Abandoned.Interaction.MysteryNote
  title: 'WEIGHBRIDGE MANIFEST: NIGHT SHIFT'
  text: 'MANIFEST 774-B / NIGHT RUN

    Outbound: 14 flatcars of cast iron pig.
    6 boxcars scrap.

    Scale recorded an unaccounted +12 tons on the last hopper
    car.

    Driver claimed the platform scale was hot from channel drafts.

    Whatever
    was inside car 9 had its own heartbeat.'
