  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Abandoned.Runtime::Abandoned.Interaction.MysteryNote
  title: 'INCIDENT REPORT: HEARTH BURN-THROUGH'
  text: "02:40 \u2014 Cooling jacket pressure dropped to zero on tuyere 6.\n03:15
    \u2014 Slag penetrated refractory brickwork. Molten iron began weeping into sub-hearth.\nSuperintendent
    ordered the tapping runner left open to divert liquid head into the channel.\nDo
    not plug the taphole. If the iron freezes inside the furnace, the plant is dead."
