  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Abandoned.Runtime::Abandoned.Interaction.MysteryNote
  title: 'MILL OPERATOR LOG: EMERGENCY STOP'
  text: 'Shift 3 handover:

    Roll stand 2 screwdown motors are surging.

    When
    the emergency stop cord is pulled, the rollers accelerate instead of braking.

    Keep
    your hands off the runout table.

    If an ingot jams in the roughing rolls,
    do not go down with a cutting torch.'
